{{also|Appendix:Variations of "z"}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Spelling variant of {{m|en|-s}}.

===Suffix===
{{head|en|suffixes}}

# {{lb|en|urban|_|slang}} Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking the plural of nouns. Usually used in words in which the [[-s]] suffix is actually pronounced "z".
#: '''''Boyz''' are always trouble.''
# {{lb|en|urban|_|slang}} Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking verb inflections.
#: ''He '''lovez''' me.''

===See also===
* {{l|en|-a}}

